ly 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (System prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [33], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Cinematic night street photograph: a model in an exaggerated balloon-sleeve white wool coat walking toward camera under a huge illuminated theatre marquee, the marquee bulbs spelling \"MOSS\" in tall capital letters, wet asphalt with long reflections, warm tungsten glow against cold blue night, anamorphic flare, 35mm film grain, low angle"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 28, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 29, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "Positive Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [451.44049072265625, 383.5557861328125], "pos": [1815.6597900390625, 1751.849365234375], "id": 26, "properties": {"